        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset SmartScan Finger Print Deadbolt Lock</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe innovative SmartScan biometric deadbolt featuring new SmartKey\r\ntechnology, combines the convenience of keyless entry with the  \r\nadvanced security of subdermal fingerprint scanning.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<LI>Features SmartKey Re-key Technology</li>\r\n<LI>3 levels of controlled access</li>\r\n<LI>Easy to Install, Program and Use</li>\r\n<LI>Backup Key Included</li>\r\n<LI>Subdermal fingerprint scan safer and more precise</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</b></p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" align=\"center\" width=\"88\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-Finish-7-ultima3.jpg?v=1704354548\" width=\"86\" height=\"120\" alt=\"kwikset smartscan\">\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Features SmartKey Re-key Technology:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Re-key your lock in seconds with the original key and learn tool</li>\r\n<li>Lock Bumping Protection</li>\r\n<li>Superior Security - ANSI Grade-1 deadbolt rating</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" align=\"center\" width=\"88\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-finish-7-4.jpg?v=1704354668\" width=\"86\" height=\"120\" alt=\"smartscan biometric deadbolt\">\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Fingerprint Scan Technology:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Once enrolled in the unit, simply unlock the door by swiping your  \r\nfinger under the sensor.</li>\r\n<li>SmartScan reads deep into the sub dermal layers of your skin.  \r\nNicks, scratches and dirt will not interfere with its operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" align=\"center\" width=\"88\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-Finish-7-2.jpg?v=1704354511\" width=\"86\" height=\"120\" alt=\"smartscan control\">\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Control who gains entry to your home with 3 levels of access:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Continuous Access-24/7 for homeowners and family</li>\r\n<li>Temporary Access-Day(s) of the week for contractors</li>\r\n<li>Restricted Access-Time and day of the week for baby sitters or  \r\nhousekeepers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" align=\"center\" width=\"88\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E14LE3_size.gif?v=1704442275\" width=\"86\" height=\"120\" alt=\"program smartscan\">\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Easy to Program:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Manage up to 50 users</li>\r\n<li>As an administrator, easily enroll or delete users in seconds</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n\r\n\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" align=\"center\" width=\"88\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/install-smartscan.jpg?v=1704442262\" width=\"86\" height=\"120\" alt=\"install smartscan\">\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Easy to Install:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>About as easy as a regular deadbolt</li>\r\n<li>All you need is a 2 Phillips screwdriver</li>\r\n<li>Stand alone system with no hard wiring</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<p><font color=\"red\"><b>*This item is discontinued</b></font>\r\n</p>\r\n<br><br><br>",
